title: A Sejm Committee of Inquiry
subtitle: Once a year, while PPS is in opposition: the Sejm looks into the abuses of the government.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: parliament_affairs
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && !!Q.polish_party_rules && PolishPolitics.inquiryOpen(Q) !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card parliament.inquiry (Z — 1.33, the user's decisions of 25 XI 2026): opened by the characteristic parliamentarism. Once a year,
// while PPS is in opposition to an active cabinet; the month's action. A gameplay simplification: the committee needs no vote.
PolishPolitics.inquiryView(Q);
!}

= A Sejm committee of inquiry

As an opposition club PPS can move a committee of the Sejm to look into the abuses of the government. [+ pl_inq_line +]

- @appoint
- @nothing
- @easy_discard

@appoint
title: Move a committee of inquiry into the government
subtitle: Cost: 0 resources. Those the committee looks into lose some support, and the authority of the Sejm grows, but our relations with them worsen. Available thanks to parliamentarism.
choose-if: {! return PolishPolitics.inquiryStatus(Q).available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_inq_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishPolitics.inquiryChoose(Q);
!}
go-to: result

@nothing
title: Do nothing now
on-arrival: {!
PolishRules.skipCard(Q);
!}
go-to: root

@result
new-page: true

= A Sejm committee of inquiry

[+ pl_inq_result +]

- @root: Continue.
